GIMP MCP Studio is a modified fork of gimp-mcp/gimp-mcp:
https://github.com/gimp-mcp/gimp-mcp
The upstream repository is distributed under GPL-3.0. Original attribution
in the source is retained. LICENSE contains the GNU GPL version 3 text.

Modifications made in this workspace, 2026-11-05, include MCP Python SDK 2
support, persistent GIMP service lifecycle, main-thread API dispatch,
noninteractive GIMP 3 export, file-operation timeouts, typed PDB discovery
and execution, GEGL filter discovery, named-layer transformations, owned-image full-composite/detail snapshots, native asset import, verified native
text editing, semantic layer inspection, and typed local-file/mask/path adapters.

This fork is not an official GIMP or Model Context Protocol project.
